s: cash acquired</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.7%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0.05pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.7%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0.05pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.24%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0.05pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> (<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_95AsBmQhZ0-8JYazjfgbjg" contextRef="Duration_6_15_2021_To_6_15_2021_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsls_ObalonTherapeuticsInc.Member_2_yL4AHXR0iZWAQPCCZ82w" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CashAcquiredFromAcquisition" scale="3" id="Tc_2izS3XVMyEuRkbIRtW7UdQ_9_3">5,207</ix:nonFraction>)</p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:85.35%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0.05pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">Total purchase price, net of cash acquired</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.7%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0.05pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.7%;border-bottom:3px double #000000;border-top:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0.05pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.24%;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0.05pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_95AsBmQhZ0-8JYazjfgbjg" contextRef="Duration_6_15_2021_To_6_15_2021_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsls_ObalonTherapeuticsInc.Member_2_yL4AHXR0iZWAQPCCZ82w" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireBusinessesNetOfCashAcquired" scale="3" id="Tc_ARVNKVVHI0qm9dlLWDw_Sg_10_3">25,355</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;min-height:0.0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:&quot;'Times New Roman','Times','serif'&quot;;font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:12pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';">As part of the warrant agreements there was a provision that would provide the holders, at their election, a cash payment based on a Black-Scholes valuation of the warrants in connection with certain fundamental transactions. This clause could be exercised by the holders for 30 days subsequent to the date of the transaction. The Company performed a preliminary valuation of the warrants and recorded a liability at the time of the merger of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_95AsBmQhZ0-8JYazjfgbjg" contextRef="Duration_6_15_2021_To_6_15_2021_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsls_ObalonTherapeuticsInc.Member_2_yL4AHXR0iZWAQPCCZ82w" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:WarrantLiability" scale="6" id="Narr_Cxchpl2rWUWPJkss-qpHCg">2.0</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';"> million. During the third quarter of 2021, the Company completed its valuation of these warrants which resulted in a liability for the warrants of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_95AsBmQhZ0-8JYazjfgbjg" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2021_To_9_30_2021_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsls_ObalonTherapeuticsInc.Member_1ffGlffEIk2cEI-RpoZaZg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:WarrantLiability" scale="6" id="Narr_Cg63OoF8LUe5N8cvggMhRQ">1.3</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';"> million, a decrease of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_95AsBmQhZ0-8JYazjfgbjg" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2021_To_9_30_2021_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsls_ObalonTherapeuticsInc.Member_1ffGlffEIk2cEI-RpoZaZg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:IncreaseDecreaseInWarrantLiability" scale="6" id="Narr_8Rcmc3Hfskal9s4IfntSog">0.7</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';"> million, which had a corresponding decrease to goodwill. The Company had </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_pdLQWq0qLUWR50EMCGL9Fg" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2021_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsls_ObalonTherapeuticsInc.Member_QralVXWK-02MmXud7BInFw" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="rsls:WarrantsNumberOfHoldersExercisedFundamentalTransactionOption" scale="0" id="Narr_OoiAz0kNK0-4mStRUqDjvA">one</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';"> of the holders exercise the fundamental transaction option, and rather than paying cash both parties agreed on the Company issuing shares of common stock and new warrants to this investor. See Notes 8 and 9 below for additional details. As the 30 day period passed, the Company valued the remaining warrants using a Black-Scholes model with an exercise price ranging from </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XsXECV5vEU2b4A8J3OA1qw" contextRef="As_Of_7_15_2021_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsls_ObalonTherapeuticsInc.Member_p-3gnpF5kkerrZHD0U3NVg" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_OLRpP6x-6UGqrGKbaYV5vw">660.00</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';"> to </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XsXECV5vEU2b4A8J3OA1qw" contextRef="As_Of_7_15_2021_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsls_ObalonTherapeuticsInc.Member_0m97LuX4q0us5F4GbYd8tA" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_Oj2HRghjoU-Sv-F2uhIKew">750.00</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';"> per share, a risk free rate of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_aOeMbxxy7EmVx5GkCS33Hg" contextRef="As_Of_7_15_2021_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsls_ObalonTherapeuticsInc.Member_us-gaap_MeasurementInputTypeAxis_us-gaap_MeasurementInputRiskFreeInterestRateMember_XVgXmxp43kScBCBb6k827Q" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingMeasurementInput" scale="0" id="Narr_YPAOHhy1-UawROkzxkH4RQ">0.44</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';">, a volatility rate of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_aOeMbxxy7EmVx5GkCS33Hg" contextRef="As_Of_7_15_2021_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsls_ObalonTherapeuticsInc.Member_us-gaap_MeasurementInputTypeAxis_us-gaap_MeasurementInputPriceVolatilityMember_wxjgn08TTkuSgtBCC94Yeg" decimals="1" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingMeasurementInput" scale="0" id="Narr_wNHqB069jkayKQBpk49Y9g">122.1</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';"> and a dividend rate of </span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-16</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_OJQUgeSLkESrpAlHG4T_gg_cont1"><p style="font-family:&quot;'Times New Roman','Times','serif'&quot;;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_aOeMbxxy7EmVx5GkCS33Hg" contextRef="As_Of_7_15_2021_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsls_ObalonTherapeuticsInc.Member_us-gaap_MeasurementInputTypeAxis_us-gaap_MeasurementInputExpectedDividendRateMember_B4H9_7wbDke4JEGGWHtmNg" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingMeasurementInput" scale="0" id="Narr_8MyH6vY9CkmAHLmmnUJtug">0</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';">. This resulted in a total fair value of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_95AsBmQhZ0-8JYazjfgbjg" contextRef="As_Of_7_15_2021_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsls_ObalonTherapeuticsInc.Member_087i46eGI0WbOqG4gB9biQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:ClassOfWarrantOrRightFairValueDisclosure" scale="6" id="Narr_yl5Dunqvg0ifeQFJrMmJHw">0.9</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';"> million as of July 15, 2021, with the change in fair value being recognized as a component of warrant expense. The ending liability of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_95AsBmQhZ0-8JYazjfgbjg" contextRef="As_Of_7_15_2021_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsls_ObalonTherapeuticsInc.Member_087i46eGI0WbOqG4gB9biQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:WarrantsReclassifiedToEquity" scale="6" id="Narr_wQZZKYGsAkSJBZ8bKGLv8A">0.5</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';"> million was reclassified from a current liability to additional paid-in capital.</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:14pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">Goodwill includes expected synergies and other benefits the Company believes will result from the acquisition. The developed technology has been capitalized at fair value as an intangible asset with an estimated life of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_9_30_2022_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsls_ObalonTherapeuticsInc.Member_us-gaap_FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsByMajorClassAxis_us-gaap_DevelopedTechnologyRightsMember_NS9rF9NTE0KIp7r0EIs_CQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:AcquiredFiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsWeightedAverageUsefulLife" id="Narr_Lnk7S57PFUOdld4cdVVxpA">15 years</ix:nonNumeric>. The developed technology was determined using the income approach. This approach determines fair value based on cash flow projections which are discounted to present value using a risk-adjusted rate of return, using nonrecurring Level 3 inputs. The discount rate used was <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_aOeMbxxy7EmVx5GkCS33Hg" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2022_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsls_ObalonTherapeuticsInc.Member_us-gaap_FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsByMajorClassAxis_us-gaap_DevelopedTechnologyRightsMember_us-gaap_MeasurementInputTypeAxis_us-gaap_MeasurementInputDiscountRateMember_sIkju-5zHkmssHQlptx-lQ" decimals="1" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsMeasurementInput" scale="0" id="Narr_B0oAGl8V5kiE0JL3IM0WVQ">22.0</ix:nonFraction>%. For the year ended December 31, 2021, the Company fully impaired goodwill due to the decline in market capitalization.</p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:27pt;margin:14pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;margin-bottom:5pt;margin-top:5pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_9_30_2022_uaRO2nRh7UWPW0I5M-gEhA" name="us-gaap:StockholdersEquityNoteDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_NQoWTijtaki5kzuCIUNajw" continuedAt="Tb_NQoWTijtaki5kzuCIUNajw_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">(8)&#160;&#160;Equity</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 18pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Common Stock Issued Related to Restricted Stock Units</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">During the three months ended September 30, 2022 and 2021, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2022_To_9_30_2022_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_lprY22FHYki_EVhNeMgUdQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesShareBasedCompensation" scale="0" id="Narr_lj3l4efEZUylteSRPDvlNA">2,321</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2021_To_9_30_2021_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_Xz731yrC-kijdRtVS4IJBA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesShareBasedCompensation" scale="0" id="Narr_AIV9tNNUB0K38H0fZNjjnA">35,115</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock, respectively; and during the nine months ended September 30, 2022 and 2021, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_9_30_2022_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_SQhfTlJNY0GqHb8idN52EA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesShareBasedCompensation" scale="0" id="Narr_Lzhru9zWsE2z7s7svZwLgQ">20,505</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_9_30_2021_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_gEJkWE8h5k2W-dgfFyVScQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesShareBasedCompensation" scale="0" id="Narr_4Pmzhhu9Dky_f51O7a3cOw">35,115</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock, respectively, subject to vesting of the restricted stock units. For further details see Note 12.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 18pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">September 2022 Cancellation of Restricted Stock Units</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_D6iP8KFGHUWBosyQ7nTBnw;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">September 27, 2022</span></span>, the Company entered into an agreement with each of its non-employee directors, to rescind and cancel, for no consideration, the issuance of an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_1_1_2022_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_xpt7lP5hfkWJQzGIa4k3LQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_dbpJ5eYRkkOIb0alc1dlKw">12,443</ix:nonFraction> restricted stock units that vested on January 1, 2022. In addition, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_director_Su_Jg1xkl0K1tgBnqm2xPg" contextRef="Duration_11_1_2022_To_11_1_2022_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_PsVYCRQ760uYtBsqnrpW4A" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="rsls:NumberOfNonEmployeeDirectors" scale="0" id="Narr_AcqjE57mEk-Kftwtb-Vttw">three</ix:nonFraction> of the Company&#8217;s non-employee directors forfeited, for no consideration, an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="Duration_7_22_2021_To_7_22_2021_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_twpqAtYy10afkZYAGhzgUQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_zsCpIARds0eK0goF0Gd3dA">7,603</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock units that were issued pursuant to restricted stock units that vested on July&#160;22, 2021. Such rescission, cancellation and forfeiture was completed on November 1, 2022.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 18pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">June 2022 Exercises of Warrants for Common Stock</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On June 16, 2022, the Company entered into a warrant exercise agreement with an existing accredited investor to exercise certain outstanding warrants to purchase up to an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="Duration_6_16_2022_To_6_16_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_ClassOfWarrantInvestorsIssuedJune2022Member_zXz4dlXX-0iWpFTFjwsWwg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesWarrantsExercised" scale="0" id="Narr_-mSgDkqM9U2P7S7asCFArA">74,773</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock, of which <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="Duration_6_16_2022_To_6_16_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewUnregisteredWarrantsMember_lY7Bys6Rc0WAKkciGTKI6w" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesWarrantsExercised" scale="0" id="Narr_n_BFRWC8fUGNAop9HMdIWg">17,773</ix:nonFraction>&#160;shares were issued in June in accordance with the terms of the warrant exercise agreement, and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="As_Of_6_16_2022_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_us-gaap_WarrantMember_qsFtqLsCZEW5VbyZE_wUMw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:NumberOfUnissuedSharesHeldInAbeyance" scale="0" id="Narr_rKqxsD5I2kW1QGe1GcqXyw">57,000</ix:nonFraction> shares are held in abeyance. In consideration for the immediate exercise of the existing warrants for cash, the exercising holders received new unregistered warrants to purchase up to an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="As_Of_6_16_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewUnregisteredWarrantsMember_sRBjWWsOiUWHWTZcAC3eig" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_AUHVEBmUXECzRW5B8BfaTA">74,773</ix:nonFraction> million shares (equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_aOeMbxxy7EmVx5GkCS33Hg" contextRef="As_Of_6_16_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewUnregisteredWarrantsMember_sRBjWWsOiUWHWTZcAC3eig" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNewWarrantsAsPercentageOfCommonStockIssuedForWarrantsExercised" scale="-2" id="Narr_RzAvawmnDEuHaNhtQHweog">100</ix:nonFraction>% of the shares of common shares exercised) of the Company&#8217;s common stock (the &#8220;New Warrants&#8221;) in a private placement pursuant to Section (4)(2) of the Securities Act. In connection with the exercise, the Company also agreed to reduce the exercise price of the existing warrants and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="As_Of_6_16_2022_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_us-gaap_WarrantMember_qsFtqLsCZEW5VbyZE_wUMw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightUnissued" scale="0" id="Narr_uXYJjN9uEE6Nuenvd0WkbA">32,190</ix:nonFraction> remaining unexercised warrants from $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XsXECV5vEU2b4A8J3OA1qw" contextRef="As_Of_6_15_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewUnregisteredWarrantsMember_okn-wxDvQkCYA-x2to6cdw" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:ClassOfWarrantOrRightCashPurchasePricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_1bWW6LqzXkqM3RYE80zOpA">300.00</ix:nonFraction> to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XsXECV5vEU2b4A8J3OA1qw" contextRef="As_Of_6_16_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewUnregisteredWarrantsMember_sRBjWWsOiUWHWTZcAC3eig" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:ClassOfWarrantOrRightCashPurchasePricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_soFURY4Qb0iwXpVInRB6kw">33.33</ix:nonFraction> per share, which is equal to the most recent closing price of the Company&#8217;s common stock on the Nasdaq prior to the execution of the warrant exercise agreement. For further details on the warrants see Note 9 below.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The gross proceeds to the Company from the exercise was approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_95AsBmQhZ0-8JYazjfgbjg" contextRef="Duration_6_16_2022_To_6_16_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_ClassOfWarrantInvestorsIssuedJune2022Member_zXz4dlXX-0iWpFTFjwsWwg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromWarrantExercises" scale="6" id="Narr_VstRkgpZvE6Rc76-HcWGow">2.5</ix:nonFraction> million, prior to deducting warrant inducement agent fees and estimated offering expenses. The Company intends to use the remainder of the net proceeds for commercial growth, working capital and general corporate purposes.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 18pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">August 2021 Issuance of Common Stock for Services</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On August 11, 2021, the Company entered into a consulting agreement in which the Company issued to the consultant <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="Duration_8_11_2021_To_8_11_2021_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_vaMBvGeHk02JkIkdTDOnNg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices" scale="0" id="Narr_EqD7BbgMIkaM9OhdEucFgA">750</ix:nonFraction> shares of restricted common stock for the consulting services in a private placement in reliance on Section&#160;4(a)(2) under the Securities Act of 1933, as amended (the &#8220;Securities Act&#8221;). The shares were deemed earned on the day of the agreement and became unrestricted <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_8_11_2021_To_8_11_2021_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_vaMBvGeHk02JkIkdTDOnNg" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="rsls:ContractExpirationTerm" id="Narr_KZp_axKaIEOaYT9A9NGefA">six months</ix:nonNumeric> after the agreement date which is when the contract term ends. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 18pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">July 2021 Exchange of Warrants for Common Stock</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">On July 16, 2021, the Company entered into an exchange agreement (the &#8220;Exchange Agreement&#8221;) with existing&#160;institutional investors to exchange certain outstanding warrants (the &#8220;Exchange Warrants&#8221;) for shares of common stock and new warrants to purchase common stock. The investors held common stock purchase warrants issued by the Company prior to the merger of Obalon and ReShape. The merger constituted a fundamental transaction under the Exchange Warrants and, as a result thereof, pursuant to the </p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-17</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_NQoWTijtaki5kzuCIUNajw_cont1"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;padding-bottom:12pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">terms and conditions of the Exchange Warrants, the investors were entitled to a cash payment equal to the Black Scholes value of the Exchange Warrants, calculated in accordance with the terms of the Exchange Warrants (the &#8220;Black Scholes Payment&#8221;). </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Subject to the terms and conditions set forth in the Exchange Agreement and, in reliance on Section 3(a)(9) of the Securities Act, in lieu of the Black Scholes Payment, the Company and the Investors agreed to exchange all of the Exchange Warrants for (a) a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="As_Of_7_16_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_ExchangeWarrantsMember_sGRKkynQFE-DJXPTlivRqg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_Qq9cvnJut0aFiGz3rJGSiQ">10,098</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock, which was calculated by dividing the Black Scholes Payment by $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XsXECV5vEU2b4A8J3OA1qw" contextRef="As_Of_7_16_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_ExchangeWarrantsMember_sGRKkynQFE-DJXPTlivRqg" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_qp2z8g2FeEmAL7AyqUGh7Q">201.90</ix:nonFraction>, which was equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_aOeMbxxy7EmVx5GkCS33Hg" contextRef="As_Of_7_16_2021_COmrPHhgyUKrmCP746oGFQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceAsPercentageOfCommonStockPrice" scale="-2" id="Narr_MNWZDFtXA0yZ0LflApciOw">95</ix:nonFraction>% of the closing market price of the Company&#8217;s common stock on The Nasdaq Capital Market on July 16, 2021 and (b) new warrants to purchase up to a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="As_Of_7_16_2021_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewWarrantsMember_2DTs3ZLIvEy1RNX0THn2Rg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_OwcoM0oXOESwBJeXZxZZ3g">8,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock at an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XsXECV5vEU2b4A8J3OA1qw" contextRef="As_Of_7_16_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewWarrantsMember_zXZSRSdsTE2yWY7xD2XN9A" decimals="3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_IPzJmb3-TUmapCGY2nqWcw">201.90</ix:nonFraction> with a term of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="As_Of_7_16_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewWarrantsMember_zXZSRSdsTE2yWY7xD2XN9A" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingTerm" id="Narr_jNz-w1Y8cU2TWoFVhPlypw">five years</ix:nonNumeric>. For further details on the warrants see Note 9 below. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 18pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">June 2021 Exercises of Warrants for Common Stock</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On June 28, 2021, the Company entered into a warrant exercise agreement with existing accredited investors to exercise certain outstanding warrants to purchase up to an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="Duration_6_28_2021_To_6_28_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_ClassOfWarrantInvestorsIssuedJune2021Member_u11U1qAWekyNcBZ1L9d8nw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesWarrantsExercised" scale="0" id="Narr_6GGTGKRAFUKj0mBLVgOxMg">158,588</ix:nonFraction> shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock, of which <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="Duration_6_28_2021_To_6_28_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewUnregisteredWarrantsMember_YglpReiq-EaHAhxoKwDAbg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesWarrantsExercised" scale="0" id="Narr_k4clPslMDEy7ajD2o4l_TQ">142,617</ix:nonFraction> shares were issued in July 2021, in accordance with the terms of the warrant exercise agreement. <span style="background:#ffffff;">In consideration for the immediate exercise of the existing warrants for cash, the exercising holders received new unregistered warrants to purchase up to an aggregate of </span><span style="background:#ffffff;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="As_Of_6_28_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewUnregisteredWarrantsMember_3GcBkDdyLEu0AuZHU1H9qQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_JMJ3WQYNHE6waC63fYbfVg">118,941</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background:#ffffff;"> shares (equal to </span><span style="background:#ffffff;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_aOeMbxxy7EmVx5GkCS33Hg" contextRef="As_Of_6_28_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewUnregisteredWarrantsMember_3GcBkDdyLEu0AuZHU1H9qQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNewWarrantsAsPercentageOfCommonStockIssuedForWarrantsExercised" scale="-2" id="Narr_hreqbaM1mEuRq-T_-HwP7A">75</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="background:#ffffff;"> of the shares of common stock issued in connection with the exercise) of the Company&#8217;s common stock (the &#8220;New Warrants&#8221;) in a private placement pursuant to Section 4(a)(2) of the Securities Act. The investors paid a cash purchase price for the New Warrants equal to </span><span style="background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XsXECV5vEU2b4A8J3OA1qw" contextRef="As_Of_6_28_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewUnregisteredWarrantsMember_3GcBkDdyLEu0AuZHU1H9qQ" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:ClassOfWarrantOrRightCashPurchasePricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_yM1Vmzsjz0uJ2UfLBBKoNg">4.6875</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background:#ffffff;"> per share of common stock underlying the New Warrants. In connection with the exercise, the Company also agreed to reduce the exercise price of certain of the existing warrants to </span><span style="background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XsXECV5vEU2b4A8J3OA1qw" contextRef="As_Of_6_28_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewUnregisteredWarrantsMember_3GcBkDdyLEu0AuZHU1H9qQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_UKmTvNP-skiVqhyXub8Lbg">300.00</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background:#ffffff;">, which is equal to the most recent closing price of the Company&#8217;s common stock on The Nasdaq Capital Market prior to the execution of the warrant exercise agreement. For further details on the warrants see Note 9 below. </span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="background:#ffffff;">The gross proceeds to the Company from the exercise and the sale of the New Warrants was approximately </span><span style="background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_95AsBmQhZ0-8JYazjfgbjg" contextRef="Duration_6_28_2021_To_6_28_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_ClassOfWarrantInvestorsIssuedJune2021Member_u11U1qAWekyNcBZ1L9d8nw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromWarrantExercises" scale="6" id="Narr_o8jh43XC-kyyJ6fQULpjVQ">45.5</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background:#ffffff;">&#160;million, prior to deducting the underwriter discount and offering expenses. The Company used approximately </span><span style="background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_95AsBmQhZ0-8JYazjfgbjg" contextRef="Duration_6_28_2021_To_6_28_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_ClassOfWarrantInvestorsIssuedJune2021Member_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_rsls_CreditAgreementMember_TqVnqt2khEGdx-ugX1WJtg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:WarrantsProceedsUsedForRepaymentsOfLongTermDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_6EA_OMHJwU6Kc8ubj7efFA">10.8</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background:#ffffff;"> million to pay off the credit agreement, including </span><span style="background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_95AsBmQhZ0-8JYazjfgbjg" contextRef="Duration_6_28_2021_To_6_28_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_ClassOfWarrantInvestorsIssuedJune2021Member_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_rsls_CreditAgreementMember_TqVnqt2khEGdx-ugX1WJtg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfLongTermDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_P0eakfjm9kKuBbb1tV4KIw">10.5</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background:#ffffff;"> million of debt and </span><span style="background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_95AsBmQhZ0-8JYazjfgbjg" contextRef="Duration_6_28_2021_To_6_28_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_ClassOfWarrantInvestorsIssuedJune2021Member_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_rsls_CreditAgreementMember_TqVnqt2khEGdx-ugX1WJtg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:RepaymentOfDebtAccruedInterest" scale="6" id="Narr_hwRJ90R3FkqcO4UqCi6P1w">0.3</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background:#ffffff;"> million of accrued interest under its secured credit agreement dated March 25, 2020, as amended, see Note 5 above for further details. The Company intends to use the remainder of the net proceeds for working capital and general corporate purposes.</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:14pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">On June 18, 2021, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="Duration_6_18_2021_To_6_18_2021_7tmUzbYuS0OB9mxlvLhjRA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_GVa3xKmQ10engm6EUOjLkA">2,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_individual_OPDhawo6C0m3srcm6fReww" contextRef="Duration_6_18_2021_To_6_18_2021_7tmUzbYuS0OB9mxlvLhjRA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="rsls:NumberOfInstitutionalInvestorsHealthcare" scale="0" id="Narr_7M9HLnM-5U2dNSxX2b8hmQ">two</ix:nonFraction> healthcare focused institutional investors, totaling <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="Duration_6_18_2021_To_6_18_2021_7tmUzbYuS0OB9mxlvLhjRA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesWarrantsExercised" scale="0" id="Narr_Fgy1gGgDAkutbVbePk7i-A">4,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock and on June 21, 2021, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="Duration_6_21_2021_To_6_21_2021_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_rsls_PrivatePlacements2019Member_uaj3kG1CTk6Z31aEHtf0xA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_-7bSMgkx9Ear7wkq0XU8zQ">2,609</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="Duration_6_21_2021_To_6_21_2021_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_rsls_PrivatePlacements2019Member_evb7yOqjE0esKBFG-kUAoQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_Kk4KPPerH02y113xKoqcAA">1,145</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_individual_OPDhawo6C0m3srcm6fReww" contextRef="Duration_6_21_2021_To_6_21_2021_LY2dtmN-9Uumfc6kVtypEg" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="rsls:NumberOfInstitutionalInvestorsHealthcare" scale="0" id="Narr_hEjHVROyF0ycVVHYA9ZS1A">two</ix:nonFraction> healthcare focused institutional investors totaling <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="Duration_6_21_2021_To_6_21_2021_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_rsls_PrivatePlacements2019Member_uaj3kG1CTk6Z31aEHtf0xA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesWarrantsExercised" scale="0" id="Narr_5PHHy43ARkOHF5nxdmEBAw">3,754</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock, as an exercise of pre-funded warrants issued in connection with the September 2019 private placement transactions. The Company received approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_95AsBmQhZ0-8JYazjfgbjg" contextRef="Duration_6_21_2021_To_6_21_2021_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_rsls_PrivatePlacements2019Member_uaj3kG1CTk6Z31aEHtf0xA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromWarrantExercises" scale="6" id="Narr_9_LwfFRe30-ZKyFihAsodQ">0.1</ix:nonFraction> million in connection with the exercises.</p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:14pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><a id="_ff4386b2_fc82_4930_903c_d8fabc8ad6bf"></a><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_9_30_2022_uaRO2nRh7UWPW0I5M-gEhA" name="rsls:StockWarrantsDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_MiOH7HjOv0OVUkkiQrcMvA" continuedAt="Tb_MiOH7HjOv0OVUkkiQrcMvA_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">(9) Warrants</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On June 16, 2022, the Company entered into a warrant exercise agreement with an existing accredited investor to exercise certain outstanding warrants. As part of this agreement the Company modified the warrants issued June 28, 2021, from an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XsXECV5vEU2b4A8J3OA1qw" contextRef="As_Of_6_15_2022_QrKFGR3x-UCRbS0xeJjmcg" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_HMBLYoAKqUiTkJYpZQuRBw">300.00</ix:nonFraction> to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XsXECV5vEU2b4A8J3OA1qw" contextRef="As_Of_6_16_2022_P8yAIGUFdkmmJ0zxaNWx4w" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_OO1PrFJmKUS-0S2LhS_OCQ">33.33</ix:nonFraction> per share. The Company issued a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="Duration_6_16_2022_To_6_16_2022_vtW3_Y8OrUuHFzFEPjTadA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesWarrantsExercised" scale="0" id="Narr_r4Wh3jJxUkyNXd7wgKKgXw">74,773</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock in connection with this transaction and issued an additional <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="Duration_6_16_2022_To_6_16_2022_vtW3_Y8OrUuHFzFEPjTadA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:WarrantsIssuedShares" scale="0" id="Narr_rdqBnqXq-EOO-96cFJvofA">74,773</ix:nonFraction> new warrants. These new warrants were valued at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_95AsBmQhZ0-8JYazjfgbjg" contextRef="As_Of_6_16_2022_P8yAIGUFdkmmJ0zxaNWx4w" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:ClassOfWarrantOrRightFairValueDisclosure" scale="6" id="Narr_Ov3RqKrH1EONj9tCLAG0vA">1.7</ix:nonFraction> million using the fair value approach at the time of issuance. The fair value of the new warrants was determined using a Black Scholes option pricing model using a risk free rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_aOeMbxxy7EmVx5GkCS33Hg" contextRef="As_Of_6_16_2022_us-gaap_MeasurementInputTypeAxis_us-gaap_MeasurementInputRiskFreeInterestRateMember_IZJZ4dhmtUSexB4K7pofAA" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingMeasurementInput" scale="0" id="Narr_iqg7_lQgqUGbnSKFLGx0sw">3.32</ix:nonFraction>%, and expected term of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_Y_qbktOuloHE23MUnTL-m72g" contextRef="As_Of_6_16_2022_us-gaap_MeasurementInputTypeAxis_us-gaap_MeasurementInputExpectedTermMember_a06kqHbeW0-ofRqaeTPIjQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingMeasurementInput" scale="0" id="Narr_BrDEoSMAPUu8ivHXswgGuQ">7.5</ix:nonFraction> years, expected dividends of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_aOeMbxxy7EmVx5GkCS33Hg" contextRef="As_Of_6_16_2022_us-gaap_MeasurementInputTypeAxis_us-gaap_MeasurementInputExpectedDividendRateMember_kro2yBcPukOJ0PW5drLzWw" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingMeasurementInput" scale="0" id="Narr_XQFYXY3LA0mbU8k-4QyseQ">zero</ix:nonFraction> and expected volatility of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_aOeMbxxy7EmVx5GkCS33Hg" contextRef="As_Of_6_16_2022_us-gaap_MeasurementInputTypeAxis_us-gaap_MeasurementInputPriceVolatilityMember_VyU-iNG3uUqBfMwZE96igQ" decimals="1" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingMeasurementInput" scale="0" id="Narr_Frpfq2pi60-POE6UGswmXw">64.8</ix:nonFraction>%. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On July 16, 2021, the Company entered into an exchange agreement with an existing accredited investor to exchange certain outstanding warrants for shares of common stock and issued new warrants to purchase up to total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="As_Of_7_16_2021_COmrPHhgyUKrmCP746oGFQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_UzJqtfO-pEqlupc8X1AGIw">8,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock at an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XsXECV5vEU2b4A8J3OA1qw" contextRef="As_Of_7_16_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewWarrantsMember_zXZSRSdsTE2yWY7xD2XN9A" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_AbkPTk_EjEOcjX6DGqteBw">201.90</ix:nonFraction> per share with a term of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="As_Of_7_16_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewWarrantsMember_zXZSRSdsTE2yWY7xD2XN9A" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingTerm" id="Narr_qsycozazOkqDQNEI8oXlIA">5 years</ix:nonNumeric>. These new warrants were valued at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_95AsBmQhZ0-8JYazjfgbjg" contextRef="As_Of_7_16_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewWarrantsMember_zXZSRSdsTE2yWY7xD2XN9A" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:ClassOfWarrantOrRightFairValueDisclosure" scale="6" id="Narr_7RS28jiAtEaXNnWyvn3f8w">1.5</ix:nonFraction> million using the fair value approach at the time of issuance. The fair value of the new warrants was determined using a Black Scholes option pricing model using a risk free rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_aOeMbxxy7EmVx5GkCS33Hg" contextRef="As_Of_7_16_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewWarrantsMember_us-gaap_MeasurementInputTypeAxis_us-gaap_MeasurementInputRiskFreeInterestRateMember_bsR4LW24OkinoMhiso-g4g" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingMeasurementInput" scale="0" id="Narr_TNBDZLaIV0OFDeZUYHZv0g">0.79</ix:nonFraction>%, an expected term of five years, expected dividends of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_aOeMbxxy7EmVx5GkCS33Hg" contextRef="As_Of_7_16_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewWarrantsMember_us-gaap_MeasurementInputTypeAxis_us-gaap_MeasurementInputExpectedDividendRateMember_JD21yyLqWEGzJube3XgXDg" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingMeasurementInput" scale="0" id="Narr_PKpUDIyp40i6hRoXOaUkTg">zero</ix:nonFraction> and expected volatility of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_aOeMbxxy7EmVx5GkCS33Hg" contextRef="As_Of_7_16_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewWarrantsMember_us-gaap_MeasurementInputTypeAxis_us-gaap_MeasurementInputPriceVolatilityMember_7F3s1KZOi0i8ObdVxyrQHA" decimals="1" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingMeasurementInput" scale="0" id="Narr_DwKsnWQlskKe8e1egcCFEQ">157.7</ix:nonFraction>%.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt;">On June 28, 2021, the Company entered into a warrant exercise agreement with existing accredited investors to exercise certain outstanding warrants. As part of this agreement the Company modified the Series E warrants issued September 23, 2019 from an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XsXECV5vEU2b4A8J3OA1qw" contextRef="As_Of_6_27_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_SeriesEWarrantsMember_C3UGTg_NwE6zcDthtIEW8A" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_dbnrscFIuEeRPJUeWxLBIg">532.00</ix:nonFraction> per share to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XsXECV5vEU2b4A8J3OA1qw" contextRef="As_Of_6_28_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_SeriesEWarrantsMember_Y2plmi4zBUGTPM0xR1YdyA" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_dlwNF2lT5Ua3idxPZ1dtCQ">300.00</ix:nonFraction> per share, the Series G warrants issued on March 25, 2020 from an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XsXECV5vEU2b4A8J3OA1qw" contextRef="As_Of_6_27_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_SeriesGWarrantsIssuedMarch252020Member_w6l8die2Fkig8Hwmo2Aldw" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_uKU46lRXwkGO3IDTutn29w">328.00</ix:nonFraction> per share to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XsXECV5vEU2b4A8J3OA1qw" contextRef="As_Of_6_28_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_SeriesGWarrantsIssuedMarch252020Member_QUsKXM5TUESVXMDV9Rf8Xw" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_I1UJR4ZYsk2LnTbxEIwvWg">300.00</ix:nonFraction> per share, the Series G warrants issued on December 17, 2020 from an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XsXECV5vEU2b4A8J3OA1qw" contextRef="As_Of_6_27_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_SeriesGWarrantsIssuedDecember172020Member_WTtu9yA2y0ejtp-jr_3NWw" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_mOU7Gd0vK0eRcmcPRZun2w">310.50</ix:nonFraction> per share to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XsXECV5vEU2b4A8J3OA1qw" contextRef="As_Of_6_28_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_SeriesGWarrantsIssuedDecember172020Member_rr7gjFz7FESDCVar7d6Eiw" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_MJ4uX4tDAUee6drxegzGeg">300.00</ix:nonFraction> per share and the Series G warrants issued on January 21, 2021 from an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XsXECV5vEU2b4A8J3OA1qw" contextRef="As_Of_6_27_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_SeriesGWarrantsIssuedJanuary212021Member_rbWKHx1QcUiQxraWu8wxHg" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_9QCVKY2qYkK_WXFry_7L2A">310.50</ix:nonFraction> per share to </p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-18</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_MiOH7HjOv0OVUkkiQrcMvA_cont1"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XsXECV5vEU2b4A8J3OA1qw" contextRef="As_Of_6_28_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_SeriesGWarrantsIssuedJanuary212021Member_bkp6JQ4r3kShQld0-ZnrbQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_aLucdMZaPEW1oqaFVrlf1A">300.00</ix:nonFraction> per share. The Company issued a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="Duration_6_28_2021_To_6_28_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_ClassOfWarrantInvestorsIssuedJune2021Member_u11U1qAWekyNcBZ1L9d8nw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesWarrantsExercised" scale="0" id="Narr_KzNba4IwHkuALsPbNsmC1g">158,588</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock in connection with this transaction and issued an additional <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="As_Of_6_28_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewUnregisteredWarrantsMember_3GcBkDdyLEu0AuZHU1H9qQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_QVnpXIjrq0C_ljLs_5BdkA">118,941</ix:nonFraction> new warrants. These new warrants were valued at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_95AsBmQhZ0-8JYazjfgbjg" contextRef="As_Of_6_28_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewUnregisteredWarrantsMember_3GcBkDdyLEu0AuZHU1H9qQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:ClassOfWarrantOrRightFairValueDisclosure" scale="6" id="Narr_TSS9UTnw_kWbVipSycuW3A">18.5</ix:nonFraction> million using the fair value approach at the time of issuance. The fair value the new warrants was determined using a Black Scholes option pricing model using a risk free rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_aOeMbxxy7EmVx5GkCS33Hg" contextRef="As_Of_6_28_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewUnregisteredWarrantsMember_us-gaap_MeasurementInputTypeAxis_us-gaap_MeasurementInputRiskFreeInterestRateMember_dkbHzxXkdkinvIAFMa4yFw" decimals="3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingMeasurementInput" scale="0" id="Narr_0d1f1OciOEiHXmarH-_mlQ">0.898</ix:nonFraction>%, an expected term of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_Y_qbktOuloHE23MUnTL-m72g" contextRef="As_Of_6_28_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewUnregisteredWarrantsMember_us-gaap_MeasurementInputTypeAxis_us-gaap_MeasurementInputExpectedTermMember_ZtlJyUxXPke6G0XRJCMi3w" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingMeasurementInput" scale="0" id="Narr_zswxDzkayEamQhvRsXULqw">five</ix:nonFraction> years, expected dividends of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_aOeMbxxy7EmVx5GkCS33Hg" contextRef="As_Of_6_28_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewUnregisteredWarrantsMember_us-gaap_MeasurementInputTypeAxis_us-gaap_MeasurementInputExpectedDividendRateMember_4oIMXgSue0-3BJQbo45mQA" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingMeasurementInput" scale="0" id="Narr_HB3gLJ_whkarMN0TWckroA">zero</ix:nonFraction> and expected volatility of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_aOeMbxxy7EmVx5GkCS33Hg" contextRef="As_Of_6_28_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_NewUnregisteredWarrantsMember_us-gaap_MeasurementInputTypeAxis_us-gaap_MeasurementInputPriceVolatilityMember_-iC1u-CmkEWsV9eQ0rY3iw" decimals="1" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingMeasurementInput" scale="0" id="Narr_q_qmyDR5OkuBKsF7Hucs5A">97.6</ix:nonFraction>%.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On January 19, 2021, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="Duration_1_19_2021_To_1_19_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_SeriesGWarrantsMember_sCg2gQ91ok-yzTgLxcjBiQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:WarrantsIssuedShares" scale="0" id="Narr_fcveqSMMHkul0hPvMOqIFg">20,000</ix:nonFraction> Series G Warrants, pre-merger, which were adjusted by the exchange ratio in the merger, to an institutional investor in connection with an amendment to the credit agreement. The Series G Warrants were valued at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_95AsBmQhZ0-8JYazjfgbjg" contextRef="Duration_1_19_2021_To_1_19_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_SeriesGWarrantsMember_sCg2gQ91ok-yzTgLxcjBiQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:WarrantsIssuedValue" scale="6" id="Narr_k_8bl_Eb0EOMNAOHDUbEIg">3.0</ix:nonFraction> million using the fair value approach at the time of issuance and was recorded as a component of the loss on extinguishment of debt during the three months ended March 31, 2021. See Note 5 above for details. The fair value of the Series G Warrants was determined using a Black Scholes option pricing model using a risk free rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_aOeMbxxy7EmVx5GkCS33Hg" contextRef="As_Of_1_19_2021_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_rsls_SeriesGWarrantsMember_us-gaap_MeasurementInputTypeAxis_us-gaap_MeasurementInputRiskFreeInterestRateMember_-R_RVaHGOUektabG6v-eTA" decima