ght:1pt;position:relative;top:0.6em;width:25.0%;border:none;margin:0 auto 0 0;"></div></div><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(1)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">At December 31, 2021, there were </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_UyDeH6EI8U2czXKPUA4y4g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_fKPilTk7DUmrDLC8Mo7qQA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="rsls:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsVestedAndUndistributedDuringPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_xsN6uKFyQU2CTn-BBTCmlQ">957</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> shares of common stock related to RSU awards that have vested and the shares were not released to the participants until January of 2022. The Company recorded a liability to account for these shares and reversed the liability once the shares were issued to the participants.</span></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:12pt;"></div></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:12pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The fair value of each RSU is the closing price on the Nasdaq of the Company&#8217;s common stock on the date of grant. Upon vesting, a portion of the RSU award may be withheld to satisfy the statutory income tax withholding obligation. The remaining RSUs will be settled in shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock after the vesting period. The unrecognized compensation cost related to RSUs at December 31, 2021 was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_95AsBmQhZ0-8JYazjfgbjg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2021_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_ANc5UiADaEqwVUcoaNbS7Q" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedShareBasedAwardsOtherThanOptions" scale="6" id="Narr_mbRr8Ls9VEWH6zu0nelygA">4.6</ix:nonFraction> million and is expected to be recognized over a period of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_fKPilTk7DUmrDLC8Mo7qQA" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedPeriodForRecognition1" id="Narr_oGVQI7I9N0eJkoSEnq2mVg">2.0</ix:nonNumeric> years.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Compensation expense related to stock options was recognized as follows:</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_cWvT7aMRfkaBO8f1uL4WQA" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfEmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationAllocationOfRecognizedPeriodCostsTextBlock" id="Tb_67jBKmo_K0-3Tcv_BCR4bA" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;min-height:0.0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:71.62%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New 